# canvas.md
size 1280 800
wait 1
canvas Moodboard
wait 1.5
key cmd+0
wait 0.8
click 480 150
move 1000 700
wait 0.3
shot mn3-canvas-overview
click 1100 600
move 900 600
wait 0.3
shot mn3-canvas-zoom-box 1040 680 240 100
down 330 60
move 800 150
up 1190 235
wait 0.3
key cmd+g
wait 0.5
shot t-frame-1
quit
